<!-- App icon (app info / Settings rows only; the app has no launcher entry).
     AshFall mark: the A and the bloom from assets/brand/ashfall-icon.svg,
     scaled to 48dp. The bloom is the same radial gradient as the source, so
     the app icon and the README icon stay one design. -->
